                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Script writing"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Do you need a book trailer, a visual narrative for your business, a primer on your work or a course you are offering? Do you want a short documentary to share your work or initiative with the world?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I am available to start from scratch and help you develop your narrative, write the script, film and edit. Or work with existing footage you have. Or come set up an interview. Or work with stock footage and voice over. It’s bespoke based on your needs (films on "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "the homepage",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "link",
                          "attrs": {
                            "href": "/"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " will give you a broad sense of what is possible)."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
