              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A miracle is simply something that is impossible from an old story but possible from within a new one. It is an expansion of what is possible. We sense that ‘normal’ isn’t coming back, that we are being born into a new normal: a new kind of society, a new relationship to the earth, a new experience of being human."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "attribution": "Charles Eistenstein"
